  "prefLabel": "Puc 304.05 Short Term Debt",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 304.05 Short Term Debt. No utility shall issue or renew any notes, bonds, or other evidences of indebtedness payable less than 12 months after the date thereof if such short term debt exceeds 10% of the utility’s net fixed plant without prior commission approval pursuant to Puc203.01.\n\nSource. #6605, eff 10-21-97 (formerly Puc 312); ss by #8448, eff 10-18-05; ss by #10603, eff 5-21-14; ss by #14106, eff 10-25-24, EXPIRES: 10-25-34 (formerly Puc 307.05) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 300)",
